---
title: Customize Colors
---

Colors are defined separately for **light** and **dark** modes inside `theme.json` under `colors.light` and `colors.dark`. Both modes share the same set of kebab-case token keys — you set a different hex value for each mode.

## Changing the Primary Brand Color

The `primary` token controls the main accent color — used for buttons, active states, links, and highlights. Update it in both modes:

```json
{
  "colors": {
    "light": {
      "primary": "#0066CC",
      "primary-hover": "#0052A3",
      "text-primary": "#0066CC"
    },
    "dark": {
      "primary": "#4D9EFF",
      "primary-hover": "#6DB3FF",
      "text-primary": "#4D9EFF"
    }
  }
}
```

{% aside type="tip" %}
Keep `primary-hover` slightly darker (light mode) or slightly lighter (dark mode) than `primary` for accessible hover states.
{% /aside %}

## Changing the Background Colors

| Token | Role |
|-------|------|
| `background` | Overall page background |
| `surface` | Cards, panels, dialogs |
| `dark-background` | In-room video area background |

```json
{
  "colors": {
    "light": {
      "background": "#F0F4FF",
      "surface": "#FFFFFF",
      "dark-background": "#1A1A2E"
    }
  }
}
```

## Main Color Token Reference

| Token | Light default | Dark default | Role |
|-------|--------------|--------------|------|
| `primary` | `#9941FF` | `#B27BF2` | Main brand accent |
| `primary-hover` | `#871EFF` | `#CBA1FA` | Primary hover state |
| `secondary` | `#000000` | `#FFFFFF` | Secondary actions |
| `surface` | `#FFFFFF` | `#000000` | Cards and panels |
| `background` | `#F5F0FD` | `#26044D` | Page background |
| `dark-background` | `#202124` | `#202124` | Video room background |
| `text-primary` | `#9941FF` | `#B27BF2` | Primary text |
| `text-secondary` | `#000000` | `#FFFFFF` | Body text |
| `text-tertiary` | `#757575` | `#B3B3B3` | Subdued / hint text |
| `error` | `#E61D1D` | `#F75959` | Errors and destructive actions |
| `success` | `#1C8731` | `#30A849` | Confirmations |
| `warning` | `#BE5702` | `#FA9F00` | Warnings |
| `border` | `#E6E6E6` | `#333333` | Dividers and borders |
| `disabled` | `#E6E6E6` | `#333333` | Disabled controls |

Refer to [`theme.example.json`](https://github.com/Vonage/vonage-video-react-app/blob/main/theme.example.json) for the complete current list and defaults.

{% aside type="caution" %}
The `on-*` tokens (e.g. `on-primary`, `on-surface`) define the text or icon color rendered *on top of* the matching background token. Always update them together — for example, if you set `primary` to a dark color, set `on-primary` to `#FFFFFF`.
{% /aside %}

With your colors set, move on to customize the typography.
